      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d101e50428ccc1668e70d7c|full_name}: Whether it actually looks more balanced is another thing but currently we're using VRIK's autofootstep which calculates a center of mass which is what I meant by trying to balance. Writing a new footstep solver is out of scope for IK2.0 for the time being. There's a decent chance that long term we'll move on to something else so this feedback is useful, but I wouldn't expect a change to where the feet get placed in the near term.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
