      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Please note that it's out of scope to largely change the positioning that the feet end up in. The final position is the same as legacy. But patch 2022.2.1p4 addresses the sliding feeling that people started to notice with the slower blend speed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
